claude/<host>/fable/settings.json = host settings.json + the SETTINGS_* delta.
Mismatch → diff, exit 1. `--write` → regenerate each mismatched copy instead.
Launcher gate: claude/fable execs `claude` with the profile, the model id, its own name as the resume
hint + the Opus host file excluded."""
